<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 233-3 AT CLOSE V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 233-3 AT CLOSE V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 233 for three at the close on the first day of the third and final test against South Africa at the Wanderers on Thursday.</p>
</text>
